WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Imagine someone stopping you for directions. You begin to answer.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Two workers pass between you carrying a door.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
When they clear, you are still talking—but the person in front of you is someone else.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
In a 1998 field experiment, roughly half of the tested pedestrians did not report the switch.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That does not mean everyone misses faces. It does not prove a meditation recording can fix it.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the source, try the free observation exercise, and decide what the evidence supports.
